-5. **Normalize:** For Expected Back-Projection, compute $\mathbf{f}_k = \mathbf{S}_k / W_k$. For Accumulated, $\mathbf{f}_k = \mathbf{S}_k$.
-6. **Completion:** The process completes in a single pass through all training views [S1].
